.vercel
.env*

# ── Repo-root safety ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This git repo is rooted at $HOME, not at a project folder. Without a
# deny-by-default rule, a stray `git add -A` stages ~/.ssh private keys,
# ~/.claude.json (OAuth tokens), ~/.aws, and shell history — to a public
# GitHub remote. Everything at the top level is ignored; re-include only
# what is intentionally tracked.
#
# To track a NEW project in $HOME, add a line: !/YourProjectName/
/*
!/.gitignore
!/BUILD_GUIDE.md
!/PathWise-ai/
